ry":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Assalamu Alaikum,\n\nI am developing Tasmey, a commercial Quran memorization application.\n\nTasmey will be offered through a paid subscription model, including a monthly subscription. The application is designed primarily for offline use.\n\nI would like to use the “Mushaf Al Madinah V2 (1421H print)” mushaf layout from QUL in Tasmey.\n\nThe layout data would be bundled inside the Android APK and iOS IPA so users can access the Quran pages and memorization features offline.\n\nThe resource would not be redistributed or sold as a standalone dataset; it would only be included as part of the Tasmey application.\n\nBefore using this resource in production, I would like to obtain clear written confirmation regarding its licensing.\n\nCould you please clarify:\n\n1. Who is the original source/author or rights holder of this specific Mushaf Al Madinah V2 (1421H print) layout?\n\n2. What license applies specifically to this resource?\n\n3. Is commercial use permitted for a paid subscription application?\n\n4. Is it permitted to bundle the layout data inside a commercial Android APK and iOS IPA?\n\n5. Is attribution required? If yes, please provide the exact attribution text.\n\n6. Are there any additional restrictions or requirements we must follow?\n\nWe would appreciate written confirmation that we may use this resource in Tasmey under the applicable license terms.\n\nJazakum Allahu Khairan.","closed_by":{"login":"naveed-ahmad","id":701567,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMTU2Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/701567?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveed-ahmad","html_url":"https://github.com/naveed-ahmad","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveed-ahmad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveed-ahmad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveed-ahmad/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://